{
  "_comment": [
    "Confluence's substance crosswalk (a maintained asset, read by data_viz/confluence.py).",
    "families: coarse buckets matching Health Infobase's vocabulary. groups: fine buckets, each",
    "inside one family, defined by das_drug_codes.pharm_subclass values (`subclasses`) plus",
    "explicit `codes` for drugs the source leaves unclassified (COCBAS, COC_HCL, PFLFENT...).",
    "`exclude_codes` drops that drug ROW from the match, not the sample: a sample holding both",
    "fentanyl and an excluded code still matches via fentanyl. terms: lower-cased V1 dimension",
    "values (dimension_value / dimension2_value) -> the family or group keys they pre-select.",
    "Refresh `terms` when a new V1 source adds dimension values; refresh `codes` when a monthly",
    "ingest-das introduces high-volume unclassified codes."
